    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright & Spacious 3-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Home with South-Facing Garden\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2003, 80 Brabazon Links is a bright and attractive three-bedroom home, offering well-proportioned accommodation and excellent potential.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a generous eat-in kitchen, with double doors opening into a bright and spacious living room and a guest WC.\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms (main ensuite) with built-in wardrobes. A family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThe garden to the rear is south-facing. \r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some cosmetic modernisation, it represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-designed family home in a popular residential development in Bettystown close to beach, shops, schools and transport options."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "DOWNSTAIRS\r\nHall: 4.94m x 3.01m Laminate floor\r\nKitchen: 4.83m x 3m Gas hob, oven, fridge freezer, washing machine.\r\nLiving Room: 5.16m x 3.93m Laminate floor, gas fire, Patio doors to garden\r\nDownstairs WC: 1.49m x 1.41m\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nBedroom 1: 4.17m x 2.91m Laminate floor, BIW, Ensuite with shower, whb & wc.\r\nBedroom 2: 3.58m x 2.84m Laminate floor, BIW, dual aspect.\r\nBedroom 3; 3.44m x 2.24m Laminate floor, BIW,\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.37m x 1.72m partially tiled, shower over bath, whb, wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright spacious home extending to 98 sqm\r\nSouth-facing back garden\r\nMain bedroom ensuite\r\nExcellent location close to transport, shops and the beach.\r\n\r\n\r\nSERVICES:\r\nGas central heating\r\nMains Water and Sewerage\r\nExcellent Broadband connectivity."
      },
